ds:concept.Design-tokens-Color a ds:Concept;
    ds:name "Design tokens: Color";
    ds:summary "This document lists all tokens that are needed in relation to color. For the most part these tokens will be of the “color” type. But some tokens like the lightness adjustment tokens for interactive states might fall under different categories.";
    ds:tier ds:global;
    ds:content "The code with which these tokens have been generated can be found under the [code tab](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vL0W-MA5QOLnQ_yZMt1xJ-tsVmiy5UD8613XCnpdi0w/edit?tab=t.8tobzs2rlba5).\n\n# **Primitive tokens**\n\n## Color\n\nPrimitive tokens\n\n#### \n\n## Numbers\n\n#### Hue\n\nTable 101\n\n#### Chroma\n\nTable 102\n\n​\n\n#### Opacity\n\nTable 103\n\n\n\n#### Lightness border\n\nTable 104\n\n​\n\n#### Lightness foreground ghost\n\nTable 105\n\n​  \n\n\n#### Lightness foreground input\n\nTable 106\n\n​\n\n#### Lightness foreground primary\n\nTable 107\n\n​\n\n#### Lightness foreground secondary\n\nTable 108\n\n​\n\n#### Lightness foreground navigation\n\nTable 109\n\n​\n\n#### Lightness text\n\nTable 110\n\n​\n\n# **Semantic tokens**\n\n## \n\nSemantic tokens\n\n​\n\n​\n\n**Foreground ghost**\n\nTable 116\n\n​\n\n**Foreground navigation**\n\nTable 117\n\n​\n\n**Foreground input**\n\nTable 118\n\n​\n\n**Foreground primary**\n\nTable 119\n\n​\n\n**Foreground secondary**\n\nTable 120\n\n​\n\n**Foreground controls**\n\nTable 121\n\n​\n\n**Icon**\n\nTable 122\n\n​\n\n**Text**\n\nTable 123\n\n​\n\n#### Dark mode\n\n**Backdrop**\n\nTable 124\n\n​\n\n**Background**\n\nTable 125\n\n​\n\n**Border**\n\nTable 126\n\n​\n\n**Brand**\n\nTable 127\n\n​\n\n**Focus Ring**\n\nTable 128\n\n​\n\n**Foreground ghost**\n\nTable 129\n\n​\n\n**Foreground navigation**\n\nTable 130\n\n​\n\n**Foreground input**\n\nTable 131\n\n​\n\n**Foreground primary**\n\nTable 132\n\n​\n\n**Foreground secondary**\n\nTable 133\n\n​\n\n**Foreground controls**\n\nTable 134\n\n​\n\n**Icon**\n\nTable 135\n\n​\n\n**Text**\n\nTable 136\n\n​  \nReferences\n\n- [Canonical Internal] [Resolvers](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/u/0/d/1OSa9BECoky3BFb-gaQfnbLbVfzfMp_r-Ot7ChcxDFTE/edit)\n- [Canonical Internal] [Global design tokens](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XXBNXVasSr1yfk_w-7Wpaeoag3tQM0y4YK6P_RYWFmU/edit?gid=561378064#gid=561378064)\n- [Canonical Internal] [Apps design tokens](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hTG_MXOEYpb6U3SVpCFNnQSDzB_LrsrABwsK3tZosH4/edit?gid=0#gid=0)\n- [Canonical Internal] [Docs design tokens](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Hk4PHbug3v8kNe65Qg0O0WMqGDI8Uhf1vvyLnD5Rv0U/edit?gid=0#gid=0)\n- [Canonical Internal] [Sites design tokens](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/179tDsNJYGKlJJbn7gxJ4khqZ6nPubaJkHZyRgH-vUGk/edit?gid=0#gid=0)\n\n";
